{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100550","id":2241730018,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6FnhXi","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100550","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100550.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100550.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100550","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100550/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100550/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100550/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/efbaa66cc340c4bd7e5570d2052f0f1b51c59ac0","number":100550,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Fix lambdas requiring extra line before End Of File","user":{"login":"Scrawach","id":40476180,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNDc2MTgw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/40476180?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach","html_url":"https://github.com/Scrawach","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"fixes #96228\r\n\r\nIt seems that when parsing code [GDScriptTokinazer](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/modules/gdscript/gdscript_tokenizer.cpp) was generating 2x`Token::DEDENT` at end instead of `Token::DEDENT` + `TOKEN::TK_EOF`. This was because lambdas have their own indent stack (`indent_stack_stack`) and it moved to default `indent_stack` after lambda parse, inside  `pop_expression_indented_block` method. As a result, this caused problems.\r\n\r\nMeanwhile, `indent_stack` is clear in `check_indent()` method, when end of file reached:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/6395450b10d73bc3515763c7bbd1b2f5b7425d10/modules/gdscript/gdscript_tokenizer.cpp#L1173-L1178\r\n\r\nI would have liked to reset `indent_stack_stack` here as well, but `pop_expression_indented_block` has error about empty stack.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/6395450b10d73bc3515763c7bbd1b2f5b7425d10/modules/gdscript/gdscript_tokenizer.cpp#L295-L299\r\n\r\nSo I had do it there.\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users